00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.640
¿Carlotta?

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:02.800
I need more…

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.080
Charlotte, is it you?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.560
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.640
 I was just...

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.480
grabbing my bag.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.080
You’ve just been missing

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.240
 for like 20 minutes.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.000
Yeah, let's go.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.840
Where do you think you’re going?

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.040
Well, I'm leaving

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.320
with Anika.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.720
We just already have plans,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.280
and I don't want to stay

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.320
at this party, so...

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.480
You aren’t going anywhere

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.360
without me.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:47.320
Here.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.960
I bought this for you.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.080
Wow.
